.TH tupr 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tupr \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tupr
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tupr ?-length N? ?-header S? ?-width N? ?-number 0|1? ?-date S? ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tupr command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tupr. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tupr(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tupr.tcl ...
.fi
